WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.160 --> 01:41.640
[Episode 7]

3
01:44.459 --> 01:48.579
Miss Ye, you seem to have two faces.

4
01:50.520 --> 01:55.300
When I'm with a gentleman, I don't need to worry about my reputation.

5
01:56.240 --> 01:57.760
Ye Ping Jun.

6
01:57.760 --> 02:01.081
Don't think you can run wild just because Master Chang Xuan indulges you.

7
02:02.599 --> 02:04.360
I know my place.

8
02:04.360 --> 02:07.640
His magnanimity is something I don't deserve.

9
02:30.560 --> 02:32.344
I saved it for your brother.

10
02:32.344 --> 02:33.600
I'll just have a little.

11
02:33.600 --> 02:35.633
It's not like you haven't eaten any.

12
02:38.880 --> 02:40.440
You're back.

13
02:40.440 --> 02:41.753
Mother.

14
02:41.753 --> 02:43.193
You must be tired.

15
02:43.920 --> 02:45.164
Have a seat.

16
02:45.164 --> 02:47.400
I made fresh walnut cakes today.

17
02:47.400 --> 02:48.857
There's also chicken soup.

18
02:48.857 --> 02:51.320
I've kept it warm on the stove. Bring him a bowl.

19
02:51.320 --> 02:53.040
- Yes. - Don't go to any trouble.

20
02:53.040 --> 02:54.960
Don't tire yourself out.

21
02:54.960 --> 02:56.673
I'll just go to my room and rest.

22
02:57.880 --> 02:59.552
Chang Xuan.

23
02:59.552 --> 03:00.892
Yes, Mother?

24
03:11.640 --> 03:13.580
Don't work too hard.

25
03:14.880 --> 03:17.259
I won't. You take care too.

26
03:33.020 --> 03:34.366
Bing Wen.

27
03:41.200 --> 03:42.680
Time flies.

28
03:42.680 --> 03:45.270
In the blink of an eye, you've become a man in your own right.

29
03:45.270 --> 03:48.710
You're no longer the boy in my memory.

30
03:49.756 --> 03:53.880
If it weren't for you, I'd have died back then in those ruins.

31
03:53.880 --> 03:55.955
I'll never forget what you did.

32
03:55.955 --> 03:58.040
No need for thanks between us.

33
03:58.040 --> 03:59.630
Don't be a stranger.

34
03:59.630 --> 04:00.699
Cheers.

35
04:07.480 --> 04:10.493
But I must remind you of one thing.

36
04:11.360 --> 04:12.960
A father is a father.

37
04:12.960 --> 04:15.819
No matter what, don't be disrespectful to him.

38
04:16.800 --> 04:20.600
I didn't know what you two discussed that day,

39
04:20.600 --> 04:24.186
but when your father came out, he looked very upset.

40
04:26.920 --> 04:28.560
You're father and son.

41
04:28.560 --> 04:32.101
Whatever it is, you can talk it out in private.

42
04:34.639 --> 04:37.853
Bing Wen, I understand what you mean.

43
04:39.640 --> 04:42.426
Military affairs are intricate and complex.

44
04:42.426 --> 04:47.005
Even cleaning up the 9th Corps won't be easy.

45
04:47.005 --> 04:48.446
You must be careful.

46
04:49.639 --> 04:51.300
Thank you for the advice.

47
04:53.360 --> 04:56.620
No matter what, I will always be on your side.

48
05:04.480 --> 05:06.200
Say something!

49
05:07.533 --> 05:10.279
You've all been cowed by Yu Chang Xuan.

50
05:10.279 --> 05:12.319
None of you dare to speak.

51
05:13.000 --> 05:19.224
Yu Chang Xuan has used military discipline as an excuse to investigate all our businesses.

52
05:19.224 --> 05:21.440
Shops are closed, businesses suspended.

53
05:21.440 --> 05:23.800
Our good days are gone.

54
05:23.800 --> 05:25.400
He's been planning this for years.

55
05:25.400 --> 05:27.070
He's left no stone unturned.

56
05:27.070 --> 05:30.160
Every move is aimed right at us.

57
05:30.960 --> 05:33.360
These past few days, he's caused such a stir,

58
05:33.360 --> 05:35.000
yet he didn't even give us a heads-up.

59
05:35.000 --> 05:37.920
He has absolutely no respect for us elders.

60
05:37.920 --> 05:40.935
San Li, don't get so worked up.

61
05:40.935 --> 05:46.280
Chang Xuan may have gone too far, but a new broom sweeps clean.

62
05:46.280 --> 05:51.620
Since he's reforming the army, as his elders, we should be more supportive.

63
05:53.960 --> 05:59.235
Yi Gang, your son is Chang Xuan's favorite.

64
05:59.235 --> 06:00.893
Of course you're not worried.

65
06:01.840 --> 06:07.459
I think he wants to replace all of us with his own men in the army.

66
06:08.600 --> 06:13.266
The capable rise, the incompetent fall, and the inferior are weeded out.

67
06:13.266 --> 06:14.839
There's nothing wrong with that.

68
06:14.839 --> 06:17.819
Scholar, spare us the sarcasm.

69
06:18.680 --> 06:20.820
Given how Chang Xuan disregards personal ties,

70
06:21.840 --> 06:23.243
you'll be investigated too.

71
06:23.243 --> 06:24.420
I have nothing to fear.

72
06:24.420 --> 06:25.800
Alright.

73
06:25.800 --> 06:27.957
Everyone, please calm down.

74
06:27.957 --> 06:29.980
You must break the old to build the new.

75
06:29.980 --> 06:31.379
Let's just wait.

76
06:31.379 --> 06:34.600
Once the reorganization is over and things are back on track,

77
06:34.600 --> 06:39.033
I believe he'll still show us respect.

78
06:39.033 --> 06:41.560
Your military ranks won't be reduced.

79
06:41.560 --> 06:43.680
Stop talking nonsense!

80
06:43.680 --> 06:46.360
I'll make this clear today.

81
06:46.360 --> 06:48.160
As long as I, Feng San Li, am here,

82
06:48.160 --> 06:52.579
he'll have to turn a blind eye to the army reforms.

83
06:52.579 --> 06:56.379
If he insists on keeping his eyes open,

84
06:57.959 --> 07:03.840
then... he'll regret it.

85
07:05.240 --> 07:08.280
[Sealed by Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

86
07:08.280 --> 07:09.560
We're just performing as usual.

87
07:09.560 --> 07:11.560
Why are you shutting us down for no reason?

88
07:11.560 --> 07:13.495
This is Advisor Li's order.

89
07:13.495 --> 07:15.160
Who does he answer to?

90
07:15.160 --> 07:16.243
It's Master Chang Xuan.

91
07:16.243 --> 07:19.519
Leave now, or you'll be under arrest.

92
07:19.519 --> 07:21.680
- You're acting above the law! - Give us an explanation!

93
07:21.680 --> 07:25.560
- Why did you put up the seals? - Give us an explanation!

94
07:25.560 --> 07:27.080
I've looked into it.

95
07:27.080 --> 07:29.665
The Spring Wind Troupe is secretly preparing a charity show

96
07:29.665 --> 07:32.280
to keep those refugees in the suburbs.

97
07:32.280 --> 07:33.960
It's strange, though.

98
07:33.960 --> 07:38.824
Qingshui Town, where the refugees are staying, has suddenly become a hot commodity.

99
07:38.824 --> 07:41.860
I heard that ten days ago, soldiers had already tried to drive them out.

100
07:43.080 --> 07:45.060
It seems someone in the army wants to intervene.

101
07:45.920 --> 07:48.912
That land is so remote.

102
07:48.912 --> 07:51.013
I can't imagine what use it could be.

103
07:51.013 --> 07:53.206
How did it get involved with the army?

104
07:54.480 --> 07:57.520
Find out who wants that land.

105
07:57.520 --> 07:58.606
Yes, sir.

106
08:01.259 --> 08:02.800
There's one more thing.

107
08:02.800 --> 08:05.785
What do you think of what I did?

108
08:05.785 --> 08:07.880
I've already had the troupe shut down.

109
08:07.880 --> 08:11.520
From today on, you'll never have to see that eyesore Liang Wen Bo again.

110
08:11.520 --> 08:13.480
Who told you to do that?

111
08:13.480 --> 08:14.978
I...

112
08:14.978 --> 08:16.720
I was doing it for your own good.

113
08:16.720 --> 08:18.000
Besides--

114
08:18.000 --> 08:20.466
Miss, you can't go in.

115
08:20.466 --> 08:21.840
Let her in.

116
08:21.840 --> 08:23.400
Why are you here?

117
08:26.440 --> 08:29.720
Master Chang Xuan, did you order our troupe shut down?

118
08:29.720 --> 08:32.430
Ye Ping Jun, don't barge in and accuse him.

119
08:32.430 --> 08:34.019
He knew nothing of this.

120
08:34.019 --> 08:35.620
- It was me-- - Li Bo Ren.

121
08:36.340 --> 08:37.340
Leave us.

122
08:37.340 --> 08:39.620
- But, Chang Xuan... - I said, leave us.

123
08:40.360 --> 08:42.025
He won't even let me explain.

124
08:42.025 --> 08:44.539
Let's go. He wouldn't let you listen anyway.

125
08:58.760 --> 09:00.040
It was me.

126
09:01.399 --> 09:02.759
So what?

127
09:06.040 --> 09:09.077
I don't know what I've done this time to offend you.

128
09:09.077 --> 09:12.421
But if you really find me so disagreeable, you can come at me.

129
09:12.421 --> 09:14.680
Why must you drag the innocent into this?

130
09:18.840 --> 09:21.401
I heard you're secretly preparing a charity show

131
09:22.080 --> 09:26.706
to lobby the Charity Union into taking in those refugees.

132
09:32.280 --> 09:33.986
I'm not asking for your support.

133
09:34.759 --> 09:36.533
But please don't stand in our way.

134
09:36.533 --> 09:38.840
Those refugees are already homeless.

135
09:38.840 --> 09:40.305
They lack food and clothing.

136
09:40.305 --> 09:45.180
If they're driven out again, their chances of survival will be even slimmer.

137
09:45.800 --> 09:47.819
War always brings casualties.

138
09:49.640 --> 09:51.579
I have no obligation to help them.

139
09:57.280 --> 09:59.160
I understand your position.

140
10:01.480 --> 10:05.390
I also heard that you just took over the 9th Corps.

141
10:05.390 --> 10:08.920
If you settle those refugees in the name of benevolence,

142
10:08.920 --> 10:12.800
it would reflect well on you and the 9th Corps.

143
10:12.800 --> 10:14.613
It's a win-win solution.

144
10:25.019 --> 10:27.039
You seem to think you know me well.

145
10:28.720 --> 10:31.306
I wouldn't presume to say that.

146
10:31.306 --> 10:32.585
It's just that...

147
10:33.440 --> 10:35.621
I'm asking you to show some mercy.

148
10:36.560 --> 10:42.200
How those outsiders live is none of my concern.

149
10:45.200 --> 10:46.700
You're right.

150
10:47.520 --> 10:51.736
They aren't from Nanhuai, but they are Chinese.

151
10:51.736 --> 10:53.570
We are all compatriots.

152
10:53.570 --> 10:56.200
Seeing our fellow countrymen suffer such terrible hardships,

153
10:56.200 --> 11:00.006
shouldn't we help them and offer them some warmth?

154
11:00.006 --> 11:02.445
Chinese should help Chinese.

155
11:05.320 --> 11:06.460
Are you finished?

156
11:09.120 --> 11:10.759
If you're done, you may leave.

157
11:14.560 --> 11:16.386
I should have known that

158
11:17.200 --> 11:21.860
coming here to reason with you would be a waste of time.

159
11:24.280 --> 11:25.546
Excuse me.

160
11:36.680 --> 11:39.640
[Yu's Mansion]

161
11:41.440 --> 11:43.080
Xi Li.

162
11:43.080 --> 11:46.193
How long has it been since we last met?

163
11:47.960 --> 11:49.120
You've done well.

164
11:49.120 --> 11:51.699
You haven't changed at all over the years.

165
11:51.699 --> 11:53.965
I can't compare with you, Zhong Quan.

166
11:53.965 --> 11:56.606
You have such a capable son to support you.

167
11:57.760 --> 11:59.520
Uncle Tao, you flatter me.

168
11:59.520 --> 12:03.317
Once I've fulfilled my dear daughter's wish,

169
12:03.317 --> 12:06.026
I can retire and enjoy my later years.

170
12:06.960 --> 12:09.560
Dad, what are you talking about?

171
12:09.560 --> 12:11.040
Look at her.

172
12:13.760 --> 12:14.893
Zi Yi.

173
12:14.893 --> 12:16.000
Auntie.

174
12:16.000 --> 12:19.699
This is a gift for you. I picked it out myself.

175
12:19.699 --> 12:21.013
Try it on.

176
12:21.013 --> 12:22.760
Auntie, this is too precious.

177
12:22.760 --> 12:25.886
Don't be so formal with me. Put it on.

178
12:27.360 --> 12:30.273
It fits well. It looks lovely on you.

179
12:31.293 --> 12:33.206
Sit down. It's beautiful.

180
12:33.206 --> 12:34.640
Thank you, Auntie.

181
12:34.640 --> 12:36.293
You're welcome.

182
12:37.040 --> 12:40.457
I've spoiled Zi Yi since she was a child.

183
12:40.457 --> 12:44.070
In the future, I'll have to rely on you to teach her proper manners.

184
12:44.070 --> 12:46.500
Zi Yi is so elegant and well-mannered.

185
12:46.500 --> 12:48.379
I couldn't like her more.

186
12:48.379 --> 12:50.399
I'll cherish her as my own daughter.

187
12:53.040 --> 12:56.136
Chang Xuan and I have discussed this before.

188
12:56.136 --> 12:59.339
Once Zi Yi graduates, we'll arrange their engagement.

189
12:59.339 --> 13:04.300
Zhong Quan, what do you think?

190
13:05.560 --> 13:06.861
What do you think?

191
13:08.200 --> 13:12.490
If they end up together, nothing could be better.

192
13:12.490 --> 13:16.559
Once the date is set, I'll handle all the arrangements.

193
13:16.559 --> 13:18.379
It's okay with me.

194
13:19.380 --> 13:24.646
But we should still ask what they think.

195
13:39.280 --> 13:41.344
We'll follow your arrangements.

196
13:41.344 --> 13:43.720
Good, then it's settled.

197
13:43.720 --> 13:45.026
Excellent.

198
14:44.880 --> 14:46.380
You're right.

199
14:47.200 --> 14:51.226
They aren't from Nanhuai, but they are Chinese.

200
14:52.560 --> 14:54.616
We are all compatriots.

201
14:54.616 --> 14:57.640
Seeing our fellow countrymen suffer such terrible hardships,

202
14:57.640 --> 15:01.480
shouldn't we help them and offer them some warmth?

203
15:01.480 --> 15:03.966
Chinese should help Chinese.

204
15:05.200 --> 15:07.680
I'm not asking for your support.

205
15:07.680 --> 15:09.993
But please don't stand in our way.

206
15:12.680 --> 15:14.498
Chang Xuan.

207
15:14.498 --> 15:18.706
What I want to build is houses for the people.

208
15:19.440 --> 15:21.073
Why?

209
15:21.073 --> 15:24.326
So they'll have a place to call home.

210
15:34.760 --> 15:36.079
Thank you.

211
15:41.800 --> 15:43.960
- Please give me one. - Thank you.

212
15:43.960 --> 15:46.026
- Here you go. - Thank you.

213
15:47.680 --> 15:49.251
I'm sorry, everyone.

214
15:49.251 --> 15:52.365
I couldn't persuade Master Chang Xuan to unseal our theater.

215
15:53.560 --> 15:54.680
Ping Jun.

216
15:54.680 --> 15:57.173
The army never approved of taking in refugees.

217
15:57.173 --> 15:59.856
It's not your fault. Don't blame yourself.

218
15:59.856 --> 16:02.820
This weekend's show will go on as scheduled.

219
16:02.820 --> 16:06.640
I've asked my friends to find a new venue for the show.

220
16:06.640 --> 16:09.440
It's in Qingliu Lane, right next to the refugee camp.

221
16:09.440 --> 16:13.536
Our costumes and props will also be moved out secretly.

222
16:13.536 --> 16:14.686
Don't worry, Director Liang.

223
16:14.686 --> 16:17.120
We won't give up until it's over.

224
16:17.120 --> 16:18.680
Yes, we'll never give up.

225
16:18.680 --> 16:21.220
- Never give up. - Never give up.

226
16:21.220 --> 16:22.560
Extra! Extra!

227
16:22.560 --> 16:25.160
The Commander-in-Chief's son, Yu Chang Xuan,

228
16:25.160 --> 16:27.880
and President Tao of Tonghui Bank's second daughter

229
16:27.880 --> 16:29.860
are soon to be wed!

230
16:29.860 --> 16:31.840
Extra! Extra!

231
16:31.840 --> 16:33.990
The Commander-in-Chief's son, Yu Chang Xuan,

232
16:33.990 --> 16:37.120
and President Tao of Tonghui Bank's second daughter

233
16:37.120 --> 16:39.100
are soon to be wed!

234
16:47.440 --> 16:49.175
What did I tell you?

235
16:49.175 --> 16:52.660
Wildflowers can never become noble peonies.

236
16:52.660 --> 16:55.213
In the end, you've been cast aside.

237
16:58.800 --> 17:01.326
Tao Chun, I'm going to help in the kitchen.

238
17:02.159 --> 17:03.159
What are you afraid of?

239
17:03.159 --> 17:04.360
Xiao Tao Chun.

240
17:12.320 --> 17:13.619
Master Jin.

241
17:17.700 --> 17:21.320
You should focus on your performances.

242
17:21.320 --> 17:23.560
Don't let me hear that again.

243
17:23.560 --> 17:25.399
Yes, Master Jin.

244
17:56.040 --> 18:00.666
The maids told me you haven't been sleeping well lately.

245
18:04.900 --> 18:06.240
I'm fine.

246
18:09.800 --> 18:11.780
It's that old ailment...

247
18:14.840 --> 18:16.406
that's plagued me ever since.

248
18:22.200 --> 18:24.240
I had someone bring this from abroad.

249
18:26.680 --> 18:28.720
It's the brand you used to use.

250
18:32.600 --> 18:34.347
The autumn wind is picking up.

251
18:34.347 --> 18:36.047
Wear more layers.

252
18:36.680 --> 18:38.220
You must take care of yourself.

253
18:45.000 --> 18:46.740
Thank you, Jin.

254
18:48.360 --> 18:49.979
You're always looking out for me.

255
19:25.480 --> 19:29.090
Director Liang, these sick children will have to stay here for now.

256
19:29.090 --> 19:30.560
- So we can give them medicine on time. - Thank you.

257
19:30.560 --> 19:32.840
Their fevers aren't going down. We still need a doctor.

258
19:32.840 --> 19:34.000
- Right. - Thank you.

259
19:34.000 --> 19:35.253
- There. - Thank you.

260
19:45.640 --> 19:48.400
I have some candy. It contains loquat leaf extract.

261
19:48.400 --> 19:50.600
It will help soothe your cough.

262
19:50.600 --> 19:52.800
I don't want it, miss.

263
19:52.800 --> 19:56.217
My friends didn't make it.

264
19:56.217 --> 19:58.358
The same will happen to me.

265
20:00.440 --> 20:01.680
No, it won't.

266
20:01.680 --> 20:03.910
We have medicine and doctors.

267
20:03.910 --> 20:06.200
You'll get better.

268
20:06.200 --> 20:07.460
Miss,

269
20:07.460 --> 20:13.713
children without a home or parents don't get to grow up.

270
20:30.480 --> 20:33.480
- What's going on? - Officer, what is this about?

271
20:34.440 --> 20:36.240
Listen up, everyone!

272
20:36.240 --> 20:39.440
We've received a report that someone here has tuberculosis.

273
20:39.440 --> 20:41.500
You have one day.

274
20:41.500 --> 20:44.240
Pack up your belongings and get the hell out.

275
20:44.240 --> 20:47.519
No one is allowed to stay. Do you hear me?

276
20:47.519 --> 20:49.700
The Charity Union decides whether these refugees can stay.

277
20:49.700 --> 20:51.160
You have no right to drive them out.

278
20:51.160 --> 20:52.600
Cut the crap.

279
20:52.600 --> 20:55.419
This order comes from the local health department.

280
20:56.360 --> 20:57.823
No doctor has even examined them.

281
20:57.823 --> 20:59.680
How can you know they have tuberculosis?

282
20:59.680 --> 21:02.044
You two think you're special, don't you?

283
21:02.044 --> 21:03.800
Seize them!

284
21:03.800 --> 21:06.159
- What are you doing? - What are you doing?

285
21:09.000 --> 21:10.380
What do you think you're doing?

286
21:10.380 --> 21:12.220
- Don't move! - Watch the children!

287
21:14.460 --> 21:16.006
You can't do this!

288
21:32.660 --> 21:34.800
Corps Commander. Don't worry.

289
21:34.800 --> 21:36.899
We will have this place cleared out at once.

290
21:47.299 --> 21:48.586
What are you doing?

291
21:50.720 --> 21:51.759
Give me the children.

292
21:51.759 --> 21:52.859
What are you going to do?

293
21:52.859 --> 21:54.799
Enough talk! Move!

294
22:05.800 --> 22:08.280
What are you doing, Ye Ping Jun? Are you crazy?

295
22:08.280 --> 22:13.715
Yu Chang Xuan, you are utterly cold-blooded.

296
22:13.715 --> 22:15.292
You've misunderstood.

297
22:15.292 --> 22:17.552
These soldiers aren't even our men.

298
22:19.200 --> 22:20.726
Who told you to come here?

299
22:21.760 --> 22:24.724
Director Liang, Miss Ye, it really is a misunderstanding.

300
22:24.724 --> 22:27.519
Corps Commander came here to distribute supplies.

301
22:27.519 --> 22:29.099
He's not here to arrest anyone.

302
22:29.099 --> 22:31.420
- They're not here to arrest us? - That's wonderful!

303
22:38.400 --> 22:39.866
- It's true. - Wonderful.

304
22:45.520 --> 22:48.000
Master Chang Xuan, I'm sorry. I--

305
22:48.000 --> 22:49.000
I...

306
23:04.400 --> 23:07.326
Lock down this area immediately. Disinfect the entire place.

307
23:07.326 --> 23:10.400
Everyone must be examined.

308
23:10.400 --> 23:14.164
Send these sick children to Renxin Hospital immediately.

309
23:14.164 --> 23:15.353
Yes, sir.

310
23:41.960 --> 23:44.560
These children's coughs are caused by a lung infection.

311
23:44.560 --> 23:46.510
Their symptoms are mild and not contagious.

312
23:46.510 --> 23:47.920
Luckily, they were brought in in time.

313
23:47.920 --> 23:49.424
They'll recover in two or three days.

314
23:49.424 --> 23:51.680
That's a relief. Thank you, Doctor.

315
23:51.680 --> 23:53.140
Thank you, Doctor.

316
24:13.880 --> 24:15.360
Hey, kids.

317
24:15.360 --> 24:16.560
Why aren't you asleep yet?

318
24:16.560 --> 24:19.573
Sir, when can we go home?

319
24:19.573 --> 24:23.080
Once you've recovered and no longer risk passing it on to other children,

320
24:23.080 --> 24:24.540
you can go home.

321
24:28.940 --> 24:30.220
How about this?

322
24:31.560 --> 24:33.920
I'll teach you a little game.

323
24:33.920 --> 24:36.280
If you play it well, you have to go to sleep.

324
24:36.280 --> 24:37.520
Okay?

325
24:37.520 --> 24:38.659
Okay.

326
24:42.180 --> 24:43.460
Look at the wall.

327
25:02.920 --> 25:04.877
Want to learn? I'll teach you.

328
25:04.877 --> 25:07.777
No, sir. I might make you sick.

329
25:14.200 --> 25:16.800
I've already asked the doctor.

330
25:16.800 --> 25:18.640
You're not that sick.

331
25:18.640 --> 25:21.280
Just rest in the hospital for a few days, and you'll be fine.

332
25:21.280 --> 25:22.440
Really?

333
25:22.440 --> 25:23.560
Really?

334
25:25.680 --> 25:26.781
Pinky swear.

335
25:47.059 --> 25:48.059
Look.

336
25:48.740 --> 25:50.519
The little bird is flying home.

337
25:51.160 --> 25:56.720
Sir, can the little bird take our secret messages

338
25:56.720 --> 25:59.660
to Mommy and Daddy?

339
26:02.119 --> 26:03.299
It certainly can.

340
26:03.960 --> 26:08.679
It'll deliver every word you want to say.

341
26:46.000 --> 26:47.141
I'm sorry.

342
26:48.000 --> 26:50.040
I misunderstood you this time.

343
26:50.040 --> 26:51.340
It's not surprising.

344
26:52.120 --> 26:54.299
After all, some people think

345
26:54.299 --> 26:58.060
I'm cold-blooded, heartless, and beyond redemption.

346
27:01.720 --> 27:06.280
Regardless, I thank you on behalf of the refugees.

347
27:07.120 --> 27:09.279
If they're allowed to stay,

348
27:09.279 --> 27:12.960
everyone here will remember the great kindness of the Yu family.

349
27:17.000 --> 27:22.640
You're making me out to be some kind of saint.

350
27:24.120 --> 27:25.739
You must be trying very hard.

351
27:28.200 --> 27:30.000
Don't celebrate too soon.

352
27:30.000 --> 27:32.099
Nothing is decided yet.

353
27:33.160 --> 27:34.500
Master Chang Xuan.

354
27:42.520 --> 27:44.200
I saw the newspaper.

355
27:44.200 --> 27:47.053
Congratulations to you and Miss Zi Yi. You're getting married soon.

356
27:47.053 --> 27:48.913
You've finally got what you wanted.

357
28:06.180 --> 28:07.440
So...

358
28:08.799 --> 28:12.079
you're no longer of use to me.

359
28:13.400 --> 28:17.373
You can no longer afford to be impudent to me.

360
28:18.299 --> 28:22.259
I won't forget the slap you gave me.

361
28:46.000 --> 28:47.000
Chang Xuan.

362
28:49.760 --> 28:50.840
I've figured it out.

363
28:50.840 --> 28:52.940
Those soldiers belong to the 27th Regiment.

364
28:52.940 --> 28:55.680
Its commander, Huang Da Kui, saw us investigating brothels recently.

365
28:55.680 --> 28:57.817
He's afraid his red-light districts won't be safe.

366
28:57.817 --> 29:00.317
So he sets his sights on the refugees' land.

367
29:01.760 --> 29:03.081
Huang Da Kui.

368
29:05.120 --> 29:07.400
One of Feng San Li's men?

369
29:07.400 --> 29:08.420
Yes.

370
29:08.420 --> 29:10.519
This is the testimony from witnesses.

371
29:18.720 --> 29:21.460
When the exam subjects were announced,

372
29:21.460 --> 29:23.480
I told everyone this.

373
29:23.480 --> 29:26.240
For company commanders and above,

374
29:26.240 --> 29:31.240
if you fail the exam, you're dismissed.

375
29:31.240 --> 29:34.616
The following is the list of officers dismissed.

376
29:34.616 --> 29:37.486
Those named, step forward.

377
29:40.160 --> 29:41.400
1st Battalion.

378
29:41.400 --> 29:44.012
2nd Company Commander Ma Jiu.

379
29:44.012 --> 29:45.012
Yes, sir!

380
29:45.760 --> 29:49.640
- 3rd Platoon Leader Song Chang Chun. - Yes, sir!

381
29:49.640 --> 29:52.640
5th Company Commander Cai Cheng Lian.

382
29:52.640 --> 29:53.780
Yes, sir!

383
29:59.760 --> 30:04.450
And the last name on the list, who also ranked last in this exam.

384
30:04.450 --> 30:09.960
Yu Army's 2nd Corps, 4th Brigade.

385
30:09.960 --> 30:13.530
Brigade Commander Feng San Li.

386
30:13.530 --> 30:15.276
How could Brigade Commander Feng...

387
30:15.276 --> 30:16.660
Yu Chang Xuan!

388
30:18.360 --> 30:19.780
Are you serious?

389
30:21.215 --> 30:23.040
I issued the regulations long ago.

390
30:23.040 --> 30:28.026
If you can't accept them, study hard and earn your reinstatement.

391
30:29.480 --> 30:31.226
Who dares?

392
30:31.839 --> 30:35.039
Yu Chang Xuan, you're wet behind the ears.

393
30:35.039 --> 30:39.840
These green brats you've brought in would wet their pants on the battlefield.

394
30:39.840 --> 30:41.480
You're telling me to study?

395
30:41.480 --> 30:43.473
I should be the one teaching them!

396
30:48.520 --> 30:51.000
Failing the exam leads to dismissal,

397
30:51.840 --> 30:54.480
and you can still earn your post back.

398
30:54.480 --> 30:58.760
But if you blatantly disobey military orders,

399
30:59.560 --> 31:02.959
the Yu Army shows no mercy.

400
31:12.200 --> 31:14.520
What can you do to me?

401
31:14.520 --> 31:16.166
Fifty strokes of the military cane.

402
31:16.920 --> 31:19.400
- Execute it immediately. - Yes, sir!

403
31:19.400 --> 31:21.174
Who dares!

404
31:24.200 --> 31:26.099
- Brigade Commander Feng! - Brigade Commander Feng!

405
31:26.099 --> 31:27.480
Are you crazy?

406
31:27.480 --> 31:28.800
Drawing your gun on the commander?

407
31:28.800 --> 31:30.553
Put the gun down!

408
31:33.599 --> 31:35.519
I don't care anymore.

409
31:35.519 --> 31:39.099
Whoever tries to strip me of my uniform, I'll make them bleed.

410
31:39.099 --> 31:42.039
I want them to feel the sting of a real gun.

411
32:05.960 --> 32:09.759
If you have the guts, then shoot me.

412
32:09.759 --> 32:11.059
Yu Chang Xuan.

413
32:11.059 --> 32:12.960
Don't push me.

414
32:12.960 --> 32:16.499
Whoever tries to stop me, I'll shoot them!

415
32:35.059 --> 32:39.380
Feng San Li, by law, I should have you shot on the spot.

416
32:40.880 --> 32:43.320
But considering your past service,

417
32:43.320 --> 32:47.606
I'll let these three shots pass for now.

418
32:48.720 --> 32:52.433
If you ever act out again, you won't get away with it.

419
32:53.120 --> 32:55.999
Fifty strokes! Execute it immediately!

420
32:55.999 --> 32:57.079
Yes, sir!

421
33:06.760 --> 33:08.581
- Take him. - Yes, sir!

422
33:24.720 --> 33:27.106
You little brat!

423
33:30.080 --> 33:32.860
Why are you standing there? Have a seat.

424
33:32.860 --> 33:34.599
How can I sit down?

425
33:35.360 --> 33:36.739
What's wrong?

426
33:38.860 --> 33:42.800
Commander-in-Chief, is Chang Xuan reforming the army?

427
33:42.800 --> 33:44.844
He's trying to take our lives.

428
33:44.844 --> 33:47.160
Let me ask you, am I one of your men?

429
33:47.160 --> 33:48.246
Yes.

430
33:48.246 --> 33:51.320
And have I been in the Yu Army long enough to be a veteran?

431
33:51.320 --> 33:52.480
Of course.

432
33:52.480 --> 33:56.086
He had some young punks teach me to read

433
33:56.086 --> 33:59.120
and had me flogged in front of my own soldiers!

434
34:00.680 --> 34:02.480
- Let me see. - Don't!

435
34:03.240 --> 34:04.359
It hurts.

436
34:07.720 --> 34:09.960
He gave you fifty strokes?

437
34:09.960 --> 34:11.181
Yes.

438
34:12.079 --> 34:13.740
What did you do to deserve it?

439
34:13.740 --> 34:16.219
I-I didn't do anything.

440
34:17.019 --> 34:18.860
You didn't?

441
34:19.740 --> 34:24.026
Did you think that just because I'm resting at home,

442
34:24.840 --> 34:28.099
I don't know what's going on out there?

443
34:28.099 --> 34:33.400
You think I don't know what you've done,

444
34:33.400 --> 34:34.659
don't you?

445
34:34.659 --> 34:35.659
I...

446
34:38.519 --> 34:39.633
Commander-in-Chief,

447
34:40.659 --> 34:43.526
I was just doing some legitimate business.

448
34:43.526 --> 34:45.360
Legitimate business?

449
34:45.360 --> 34:49.000
- Yes. - You dare say it wasn't dirty business?

450
34:52.666 --> 34:53.699
It wasn't.

451
34:53.699 --> 34:55.159
Feng San Li.

452
34:56.000 --> 35:00.380
You keep saying that you're my man and that you're a veteran.

453
35:00.380 --> 35:02.613
You've disgraced me!

454
35:10.760 --> 35:11.820
Enough.

455
35:13.219 --> 35:15.039
Go back and reflect on what you've done.

456
35:15.039 --> 35:18.980
I'll handle the rest.

457
35:20.600 --> 35:22.080
Yes, sir.

458
35:24.719 --> 35:26.139
Do you have any idea

459
35:26.139 --> 35:29.640
how many people have come here to complain against you?

460
35:29.640 --> 35:32.590
They've almost worn down the rosewood threshold at my door.

461
35:32.590 --> 35:35.699
You taught me to balance mercy with authority.

462
35:35.699 --> 35:38.840
Without a show of force, how can one show compassion?

463
35:41.120 --> 35:45.340
The various ranks in the army are all interconnected.

464
35:45.340 --> 35:46.693
It's not that simple.

465
35:47.760 --> 35:51.440
These problems must be dealt with gradually.

466
35:51.440 --> 35:53.586
You can't just use drastic measures.

467
35:54.280 --> 35:58.373
You believe in healing arts, using mild remedies for a slow solution.

468
35:59.299 --> 36:02.679
But I believe that once a tumor is discovered,

469
36:02.679 --> 36:05.300
it must be removed immediately.

470
36:05.300 --> 36:10.326
Otherwise, if it spreads to vital organs, it'll be incurable.

471
36:11.980 --> 36:15.279
You're making examples of them.

472
36:16.440 --> 36:19.800
But with so many officers dismissed, who will fill the vacancies?

473
36:19.800 --> 36:24.800
The men I'm bringing in are trained in modern firearms and military tactics.

474
36:24.800 --> 36:28.920
Putting them in those posts is the real reform of the Yu Army.

475
36:30.880 --> 36:33.220
So you already have candidates ready.

476
36:34.320 --> 36:37.693
Seems you've been planning to replace them for a long time.

477
36:38.440 --> 36:42.860
Where did you find all these men?

478
36:42.860 --> 36:44.420
The Cheng Army POW camp.

479
36:51.560 --> 36:53.896
Marshal Xu captured a group of officers

480
36:53.896 --> 36:57.360
who were trained at Japanese military academies.

481
36:57.360 --> 37:02.039
The Yu Army's reform must start with talent.

482
37:05.480 --> 37:06.586
East Wind.

483
37:14.240 --> 37:15.519
North Wind.

484
37:16.466 --> 37:17.659
Sister.

485
37:17.659 --> 37:18.719
One Character.

486
37:19.400 --> 37:20.440
Peng.

487
37:27.960 --> 37:29.000
Three Character.

488
37:36.440 --> 37:38.286
- Mahjong? - Let me see.

489
37:39.499 --> 37:41.340
Look, she won! And it's a Pure One Suit.

490
37:41.340 --> 37:42.960
- Again? - I won.

491
37:42.960 --> 37:45.900
- What a big hand. - Pay up.

492
37:45.900 --> 37:48.599
You're on a lucky streak.

493
37:48.599 --> 37:50.000
Bao Ru,

494
37:50.000 --> 37:53.960
lately, I'm just glad my luck hasn't run out.

495
37:54.800 --> 37:59.880
With Chang Xuan's reforms, my San Li has become a prime target.

496
37:59.880 --> 38:03.840
I really don't know how much longer he'll keep his post.

497
38:04.680 --> 38:06.760
How can you say that?

498
38:07.679 --> 38:10.860
You've watched Chang Xuan grow up since he was born.

499
38:10.860 --> 38:13.920
Our bonds are deep.

500
38:15.440 --> 38:20.706
For Chang Xuan's reforms, he needs his uncles to cooperate a little.

501
38:22.099 --> 38:25.760
He was quite harsh.

502
38:25.760 --> 38:28.740
We're on the same side here.

503
38:30.619 --> 38:32.300
Hurry, shuffle the tiles.

504
38:32.300 --> 38:33.960
I can't even keep up.

505
38:36.219 --> 38:37.219
West Wind.

506
38:40.099 --> 38:41.340
Four Dots.

507
38:42.199 --> 38:43.460
Mahjong!

508
38:44.840 --> 38:46.119
Again?

509
38:47.380 --> 38:49.539
Bao Ru, you're too kind to me.

510
38:49.539 --> 38:51.960
Your luck is unstoppable today.

511
38:52.720 --> 38:55.220
I'm so happy. It's a great day.

512
39:02.699 --> 39:05.219
Birthday girl, here comes your cake!

513
39:07.600 --> 39:08.980
Light the candles.

514
39:11.000 --> 39:13.940
Happy birthday, sweetheart.

515
39:13.940 --> 39:15.159
Thank you, Dad.

516
39:15.159 --> 39:16.300
Thank you, Mom.

517
39:16.300 --> 39:17.600
Alright, blow out the candles.

518
39:17.600 --> 39:21.115
Son, today is your birthday.

519
39:21.115 --> 39:24.019
- Happy birthday from Mom and Dad. - Happy birthday from Mom and Dad.

520
39:24.019 --> 39:28.320
Dad, Mom, I'm not hungry. You eat it.

521
39:28.320 --> 39:29.960
- It's for you. - No, you eat it.

522
39:29.960 --> 39:31.719
- Be good. - Eat it.

523
39:34.079 --> 39:36.940
This is bad. Hurry!

524
39:38.000 --> 39:39.740
Here. Have a bite.

525
39:39.740 --> 39:41.440
Dad made you longevity noodles.

526
39:41.440 --> 39:43.430
- Don't be afraid. - Don't be afraid.

527
39:43.430 --> 39:45.199
- Don't be afraid. - Don't be afraid.

528
39:50.300 --> 39:52.059
Let's set off fireworks.

529
39:56.900 --> 39:58.920
Another explosion!

530
39:58.920 --> 40:02.550
Dad, Mom, I'm so scared.

531
40:02.550 --> 40:05.650
Don't be. Just think of it as fireworks.

532
40:06.280 --> 40:10.320
Look. How bright the fireworks are!

533
40:17.460 --> 40:20.400
Dad! Mom!

534
40:20.400 --> 40:23.519
Mom, wake up!

535
40:23.519 --> 40:26.840
Dad, please wake up!

536
40:26.840 --> 40:29.340
Dad!

537
40:29.340 --> 40:30.960
Mom!

538
40:30.960 --> 40:33.280
Please wake up!

539
40:33.280 --> 40:34.960
Mom!

540
40:41.160 --> 40:43.440
I've grown up.

541
40:43.440 --> 40:45.320
Congratulations, my daughter.

542
40:45.320 --> 40:47.699
You've wanted to be a reporter since you were little.

543
40:47.699 --> 40:49.846
Now you've achieved your dream.

544
40:51.200 --> 40:53.006
I love journalism.

545
40:53.006 --> 40:56.223
I want to help more people see beyond their own.

546
40:57.640 --> 40:58.921
What about you?

547
41:04.179 --> 41:06.720
What do you want to be when you grow up?

548
41:11.040 --> 41:12.760
It's been so many years.

549
41:12.760 --> 41:14.720
Why haven't you grown up yet?

550
41:20.679 --> 41:24.279
Because I'll never grow up.

551
41:40.000 --> 41:44.000
Every scene you saw today is real.

552
41:44.000 --> 41:46.040
In the refugee camp on the outskirts,

553
41:46.040 --> 41:50.826
people suffer from hunger and cold every day

554
41:51.560 --> 41:53.560
and the pain of losing loved ones.

555
41:54.360 --> 41:57.093
If war is inevitable,

556
41:58.000 --> 42:02.824
I implore you all to lend them a helping hand.

557
42:02.824 --> 42:07.664
At least give them a place to call home in Nanhuai City

558
42:09.800 --> 42:12.293
and a chance to survive.

559
42:12.920 --> 42:15.633
Let our suffering compatriots

560
42:16.199 --> 42:20.320
feel warmth once again.

561
42:21.340 --> 42:26.320
I ask that you all show compassion for the victims and give generously.

562
42:26.320 --> 42:31.099
The Spring Wind Troupe is deeply grateful.

563
43:08.273 --> 43:12.480
- Bravo! - Bravo!

564
43:12.480 --> 43:15.553
- Bravo! - Bravo!

565
43:24.639 --> 43:27.820
Miss, a gentleman asked me to give you this.

566
43:54.200 --> 43:58.020
[Jiang Xue Ting]
